":"2025-05-11T15:28:25Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",29,1],"Message":"chore(build): update Maintain submodule to latest commit\n\nThis updates the Maintain submodule reference to commit 6786c3a. As part of Land's infrastructure, Maintain likely contains shared tooling configurations, CI/CD pipelines, or maintenance scripts critical for the project's development workflow.\n\n- Ensures compatibility with latest internal toolchain improvements\n- May include updates to build processes affecting Mountain/Tauri integration\n- Could contain dependency version alignments required for Cocoon's Node.js environment\n- Maintains synchronization with upstream maintenance repository changes","SHA":"c4e2e5d77afa65dd88651b7ac110f55d04407e16"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T15:26:25Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",29,1],"Message":"","SHA":"8744a599a111cf7964b68502b6c9a8f8b0324c3f"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T15:26:24Z","File":["⣿⣿⠁⠀⠀",29,12],"Message":"chore(build): update component submodules to latest commits\n\nUpdate Git submodules for core Land components to incorporate recent development changes:\n- Mountain (Tauri backend): Updated Rust/Tauri core application logic\n- Sky (Web frontend): Includes UI/UX improvements for editor interface\n- Cocoon (Extension host): Enhances VS Code extension compatibility shims\n- Shim: Updates JavaScript API bridging layer\n- Echo: Synchronizes shared protocol constants and data structures\n- River/Sun: Improves abstract filesystem layer implementations\n\nThis ensures cross-component compatibility and integrates performance optimizations, bug fixes, and feature implementations across the architecture. Regular submodule updates are critical for maintaining development velocity as we approach MVP milestones in the Electron-to-Tauri migration effort.","SHA":"b55aa913334f49d2237fb6ff86939161074e2137"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-11T15:23:40Z","File":["⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",29,1],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeE