[{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-23T00:57:03Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"2aca44c460da151a8a3423e61820fd4bc226b02e"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T05:59:18Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"64814b6728f543444b6d690c86502c19b9e14854"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T04:58:34Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(Cocoon): update submodule to latest revision\n\n- Updates the Cocoon extension host shim submodule to commit aab646c\n- Likely includes critical fixes/improvements to VS Code extension compatibility layer\n- Ensures proper IPC communication between Mountain backend and Node.js extension host\n- Maintains alignment with Path A strategy of running unmodified extensions via shim layer\n- May introduce new API shims or resolve extension lifecycle management issues","SHA":"0831a0d51aa9c534ba7e595c2f45139614f32e63"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T04:49:49Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(submodules): Update submodules to latest revisions\n\n- Synchronized submodule revisions across multiple Land components to ensure cross-component compatibility and leverage latest developments\n- Affected submodules include Cocoon (extension host shim), Mountain (Tauri backend), Echo (API contracts), Rest (JS bundler), River/Sun (FS libs), and UI components (Sky/Wind)\n- Maintains alignment with ongoing architectural refinements in RPC layer (Vine), state management (AppState), and extension environment bootstrap\n- Ensures recent performance optimizations and API contract updates from individual components are integrated into main project","SHA":"e6ec0db1cbd80f3a5f27961aa3c03410ae8fbbcd"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T04:40:10Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(license): Migrate project to CC0 1.0 Universal license\n\n- Replaced custom Land Public License v1.0 with CC0 1.0 Universal license\n  to dedicate work to public domain, simplifying reuse and distribution\n  while aligning with open source community standards\n- Updated all submodule dependencies (Document, Echo, Mountain, Rest, etc.)\n  to versions compatible with license change and current architecture\n- Removed complex copyleft provisions and compatibility clauses from LPL\n  in favor of permissive CC0 model, reducing compliance overhead\n- Maintains project's commitment to openness while enabling broader adoption\n  across commercial and non-commercial use cases\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Project licensing changed from custom copyleft (LPL) to public domain dedication (CC0). All contributors must acknowledge new license terms.","SHA":"8c284c2fa1b0578a993ddf1aa156e40553e454e4"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T03:40:23Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Element into Current","SHA":"014ab2b7f6edc4e57dea332423196e5423b8220d"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-22T03:40:14Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(build): update Cocoon and Worker submodules\n\n- Updates Cocoon (extension host shim) to latest commit, ensuring compatibility with latest VS Code extension API shims and RPC protocol improvements\n- Updates Worker submodule to latest version, incorporating performance optimizations for background processing tasks in the web worker environment\n\nThese submodule updates represent routine integration of upstream improvements from component repositories. For Cocoon, this likely includes critical fixes for extension host communication via Vine IPC and enhanced shim layer stability. The Worker update improves reliability of computationally intensive operations in Sky UI components while maintaining separation from main thread.","SHA":"201211b1bbfeebd4c70b8ab4e333d253c7de79bb"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-22T00:57:04Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"3f640f43785dd612bc1b54f8de471cde5d18cf7f"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:58:15Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(Cocoon): Update submodule to latest revision\n\n- Updates Cocoon (extension host shim) to commit 6d89c6b from previous baf3b44\n- Likely includes improvements to VS Code extension compatibility shims or IPC layer reliability\n- Aligns with Path A strategy to maintain extension parity during Electron-to-Tauri migration\n- May address specific extension host bootstrap sequencing or RPC protocol edge cases\n- Requires verification of shim layer stability with core VS Code extension APIs","SHA":"51ab4025019e09f9672f8518d9cc4b2a26829444"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:25:04Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(Maintain): Update submodule to latest commit\n\nUpdated the Maintain submodule pointer to commit 29d86d9 from the upstream repository. This submodule likely contains shared infrastructure code or configuration critical for Land's development workflow, potentially including:\n- Dependency management updates for Tauri/Rust toolchain\n- CI/CD pipeline improvements for cross-platform builds\n- Documentation generation enhancements\n- Shared linting/formatting rules enforcement\n\nWhile specific changes aren't visible in this diff, submodule updates ensure the Land project benefits from latest maintenance improvements and remains compatible with evolving toolchain requirements.","SHA":"482b3ff0826cd01fc0338cbad8629d569d282bfb"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:22:56Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(dependencies): Update submodule dependencies\n\n- Updated core component submodules to latest revisions across the Land architecture:\n  - `Mountain` (Tauri backend): Enhancements to process management and RPC handlers\n  - `Echo` (API contracts): Updated protocol definitions for IPC communication\n  - `Rest` (JS bundler): Improved extension host bundling configuration\n  - `Shim` (Extension compatibility): Additional VS Code API surface implementations\n  - `River`/`Sun` (Native FS): File system operation optimizations\n  - `Sky` (Web UI): VS Code UI integration improvements\n  - Other components (`Wind`, `Worker`, `Output`, `Document`, `Maintain`): Dependency updates and build improvements\n\nThis synchronized update ensures cross-component compatibility while incorporating performance optimizations and expanded API support needed for VS Code extension compatibility in the Cocoon shim layer. The changes support Land's core objectives of maintaining Electron-level functionality with Tauri's performance benefits.","SHA":"3d31a7742b79314b2699165bbd177e78005f3910"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:20:38Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Element into Current","SHA":"d40532b9b72d96202e0718dfc074e6798cc5bfae"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-21T05:20:34Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(Cocoon): Update submodule to latest revision\n\n- Updates Cocoon extension host shim to commit baf3b44\n- Aligns with ongoing development of VS Code extension compatibility layer\n- Likely includes improvements to Node.js sidecar process initialization\n  or enhancements to ExtHostExtensionService shim implementations\n- Maintains synchronization between Mountain's IPC layer and extension host\n  environment during active development phase\n- Part of iterative updates to ensure API contract (Echo) stability\n  between core components during MVP implementation","SHA":"7746e6388bb5a9b3a07abe50c66b9443635017b4"},{"Author":"Auto","Date":"2025-05-21T00:57:35Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"","SHA":"9d11e8c1614eeeb7a74534ff8e3f6dae901d5947"},{"Author":"Nikola Hristov","Date":"2025-05-20T18:25:11Z","File":["⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",0,0],"Message":"chore(submodules): update submodule revisions\n\n- Updates `Sky` (frontend) to latest revision for UI/UX improvements in Tauri webview\n- Updates `Output` build artifacts directory to new version with optimized bundling configuration\n- Updates `Sun` native filesystem library to latest Rust implementation\n- Updates `M